{"full":"ripienaar/free-for-dev","name":"free-for-dev","description":"A list of SaaS, PaaS and IaaS offerings that have free tiers of interest to devops and infradev","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":139139,"forks":14707,"created":"2015-03-18T21:06:26Z","updated":"2026-10-03T15:36:19Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://free-for.dev/","topics":["awesome-list","free-for-developers"],"demo":null,"color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:17.158Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:17.158Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T06:51:17.158Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:33.345Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:33.215Z","stars":139121,"forks":14702},{"at":"2026-10-04T06:51:17.158Z","stars":139139,"forks":14707}],"technologies":[],"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T04:53:39.990Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T04:53:39.990Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/324e77b3f045f2c74a8b922f.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-03T04:55:14.667Z","url":"https://mintlify.com/"}],"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T04:55:11.133Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T06:01:24.447Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Developers and open-source authors now have many services offering free tiers, but finding them all takes time to make informed decisions.","This is a list of software (SaaS, PaaS, IaaS, etc.) and other offerings with free developer tiers.","The scope of this particular list is limited to things that infrastructure developers (System Administrators, DevOps Practitioners, etc.) are likely to find useful. We love all the free services out there, but it would be good to keep it on topic. It's a grey line sometimes, so this is opinionated; please don't feel offended if I don't accept your contribution."],"features":["Abby - Open-Source feature flags & A/B testing. Configuration as Code & Fully Typed Typescript SDKs. Strong integration with Frameworks such as Next.js & React. Generous free tier and cheap scaling options.","ConfigCat - ConfigCat is a developer-centric feature flag service with unlimited team size, excellent support, and a reasonable price tag. Free plan up to 10 flags, two environments, 1 product, and 5 Million requests…","Flagsmith - Release features with confidence; manage feature flags across web, mobile, and server-side applications. Use our hosted API, deploy to your own private cloud, or run on-premise.","GrowthBook - Open source feature flag and A/B testing provider with built-in Bayesian statistical analysis engine. Free for up to 3 users, unlimited feature flags and experiments.","Rollgate - EU-hosted feature flag management with scheduled releases, instant rollback, and A/B testing. 12 SDKs included. Free plan up to 500K API requests/month, unlimited flags, 3 team members, no credit card…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ripienaar/free-for-dev/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"fd6b9b4adfaf6f485e8774c25b8261958c201fd7ab1d6e890df66d4a92f88a8b","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T16:21:16.469Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:33.307Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T15:36:19Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Developers and open-source authors now have many services offering free tiers, but finding them all takes time to make informed decisions.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ripienaar/free-for-dev/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Endpoints can be created from the API with no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ripienaar/free-for-dev/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"ip-api - IP Geolocation API, Free for non-commercial use, no API key required, limited to 45 req/minute from the same IP address for the free plan.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ripienaar/free-for-dev/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"LoginLlama - A login security AP